  branch "silent" has an adventure description and no Opening.md. Velvet Lattice reads a node's prompt as its Opening or, failing that, its description — so this leaf would open the adventure with its own blurb rather than a scene. Give the branch an opening:, or drop the adventureDescription: it inherits.
